References
----------

The board support (firmware/remote/components/board) was written from
Waveshare's schematics, wiki and demos for its ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD boards
(the 7B, 7, 5, 5B, 4.3, 4.3B and 4.3C; github.com/waveshareteam, Apache
License 2.0) and its Waveshare-ESP32-components board support package
(Apache License 2.0), ESPHome's waveshare_io_ch32v003 component, and
Espressif's esp_io_expander_ch422g and ESP32_Display_Panel, used as
references for pins, panel timings, register addresses and limits.

